// Hook files of this mod, included explicitly.
// The folder "hooks/" sits at the top level of the game's data and is shared with every other mod that
// ships a top-level "hooks/" folder (e.g. Draugr Reduced HP). Enumerating the whole folder would also
// run those mods' files a second time, so only this mod's own files are listed here.
